1. Open the terminal in the root directory of the project
2. If you are trying to execute it on Mac / Linux
    - chmod +x gradlew 
3. To execute the code run 
    - .\gradlew run --args="'CAN_TRACE_FILE_LOC' 'GPS_TRACE_FILE_LOC'" (Single quotes required)
4. URL is displayed in the console
    - If the URL is not opening from the console open it directly from the website folder (index.html)
5. Copy paste the socket port when prompted in the browser